# Demon Wall's "can attack as though it didn't have defender" (CR 609.4) answers defender only: an effect that says the
# creature can't attack is a restriction of its own (CR 508.1c). Bot1's Wall gets two +1/+1 counters on turn 3. On turn 4
# Bot2's Spara's Adjudicators enters and says the Wall "can't attack or block until your next turn": on turn 5 the Wall can't
# attack (the refusal) though the Ornithopter does (the control). Bot2's turn 6 ends the effect, and on turn 7 the Wall
# attacks as a 5/5; the Adjudicators alone can't block it (menace, CR 702.110b), so Bot2 goes from 20 to 15.

